    old "I'll slaughter each and every one of you, and when I'm done, I'll wear your flayed skin as a trophy to show to your loved ones."
    new "お前たちを一人残らず殺し尽くし、剥いだ皮を戦利品として身に纏い、お前の愛する者たちに見せびらかしてやる。"






    # game/data/travel_events/raider.rpy:56
    old "There's no need to fight, I know where a much better haul is..."
    new "戦う必要はないよ、もっと良い獲物のありかは知ってるんだ…"






    # game/data/travel_events/raider.rpy:68
    old "I'll give you what you want..."
    new "お前の望み...与えてやる。"






